well an olympic medalist is back home in  the silver state  local swimmer erica sullivan took silver  at the tokyo olympics now that she's  back here in the valley  she shared her experience with fans at  the las vegas ballpark tonight  madison kimbrough joins us live from  downtown summerlin with more madison  yes las vegas local erica sullivan is  officially  an olympic silver medalist and we got  the chance to sit down with her here at  the las vegas ballpark  to hear how this win is historical on so  many levels  my dad's rule was just like we have a  pool in our backyard just being you know  vegas kid  he said i want to be able to like turn  away and she can still swim pretty okay  as the daughter of a collegiate swimmer  we'd say she has exceeded  okay as she is now a usa swimming member  olympic silver medalist at just 20 years  old erica sullivan captured the silver  medal in the first ever women's  1500 meter freestyle a feat that has  never been done before  until now this race is considered  historical because  prior to this olympics the 800 was as  high as what they allowed women to do  so this is historically the first 1500  meter freestyle ever in the olympic  games  to be a woman one who was of asian  descent and a part of the lgbtq plus  community  bringing this medal back home to vegas  where her love for swimming began  means everything i'm asian american and  i was able to do it in japan  and i'm also a queer woman so i like and  just me being very you know  a pro woman so to speak getting to do a  historical women's event just really hit  home to me  due to the coronavirus the olympics were  put on hold back in 2020  but sullivan says she is just thankful  she got to be a part of the 2021 tokyo  games  her first time competing in the olympics  honestly there was a point when we  didn't even think the games were going  to happen  and we had this hanging fate over our  heads where  if one of us tested positive we were all  going to go home it was a dream honestly  you know getting to be  with six other girls who are your  closest friends that you've known for a  few years and  work as hard as you can for a common  goal which is bring home some medals for  team usa and  now that sullivan is back home in vegas  what is her next move  college she will start her freshman year  at the university of texas  at austin in the fall reporting live  madison kimbrough 8 news now
 

